<par def='2'>4. <run><font size='11pt'/>Administrators can Soft Delete orders with the status New, Submitted and Cancelled only.  If you want to delete "On Order" and "Partially Received" orders, you have to cancel the orders first to make sure the committed amounts are adjusted.  You cannot delete a "Reconciled" order, as a work around; you can change the cost to zero and save the order.  Note, the user with the role [LNOG Admin] have the ability to bypass the soft delete rules and could delete reconciled orders if needed.</run></par>
<par def='1'/></richtext></item>
